# **COOKIE POLICY**

**FOR ALAMA WEBSITE**  
*Effective Date: 06/05/2026*

This Cookie Policy explains how Blue Tern ("we", "us", or "our") uses cookies and similar technologies on the Alama Plugin landing page ("Landing Page"). It complements our [Privacy Policy](alama-privacy-policy) and is governed by the **General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)** and the **Belgian Data Protection Act of 30 July 2018**.

By using the Landing Page, you consent to the use of cookies as described in this Policy.

---

## **1. What Are Cookies?**

Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They enable the website to remember your actions and preferences over a period of time.

---

## **2. Types of Cookies We Use**


| **Cookie Type**        | **Purpose**                                                                                   | **Legal Basis (GDPR)**             | **Retention Period** |
| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------- |
| **Strictly Necessary** | Enable core functionality (e.g., security, load balancing).                                   | Legitimate Interest (Art. 6(1)(f)) | Session duration     |
| **Analytics**          | Collect anonymous usage data (e.g., visitor numbers, page views) to improve the Landing Page. | Consent (Art. 6(1)(a))             | 24 months            |
| **Functional**         | Remember your preferences (e.g., language, region).                                           | Consent (Art. 6(1)(a))             | 12 months            |


We **do not** use advertising or tracking cookies for marketing purposes.

