## **4. Your Cookie Choices**

- **Consent**: You can accept or reject non-essential cookies (Analytics, Functional) via our cookie consent banner.
- **Withdraw Consent**: You can withdraw consent at any time by:
  - Clicking the **"Manage Cookie Preferences"** link on the Landing Page.
  - Clearing your browser cookies.
  - Using browser settings to block or delete cookies.
- **Browser Controls**: Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies. However, blocking strictly necessary cookies may impact the functionality of the Landing Page.

